      "label": "sign_language_communication",
      "description": "A scene depicting a woman using American Sign Language (ASL) to communicate with a man who is gesturing with his hands. The woman is seated and actively signing, while the man is facing her, partially visible. The scene is overlaid with text that reads 'the first rule of deaf club..' and 'nyou nu not nalk amout nef-glub', referencing a humorous trope about secrecy within the deaf community.",
