      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme perpetuates a harmful stereotype that the deaf community is secretive or exclusive, which misrepresents the openness and visibility of the deaf community. This stereotype can be offensive and potentially harmful to members of the deaf community.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_336dcc57"
      },
